(Bug #14 regression: a period NOT followed by `but` must still end the whole
chain, same as before the fix. The final branch's period is followed by a
blank line and an unrelated statement, which must run exactly once after the
loop completes -- not once per loop iteration, and not absorbed into the
chain as another branch.)

a list called fs is ["x", "y", "z"].
For each f in fs,
  Continue,
    but if f is equal to "x" print "got x".
    but if f is equal to "y" print "got y".

Print "loop done".
